          "kind": "text",
          "value": "Explanation: Var(XY) = E[X²Y²] - (E[XY])². Since independent: E[XY]=E[X]E[Y]=200, E[X²]=Var(X)+E[X]²=102,\nE[Y²]=Var(Y)+E[Y]²=404. E[X²Y²]=E[X²]E[Y²]=102×404=41208. Var(XY)=41208-40000=1208."
        }
